# QMS Audit Checklist Generator

Generate EU GMP compliant audit checklists for internal audits and inspection preparation.

## Activation
- User requests: "audit checklist", "self-inspection", "internal audit", "inspection prep", "GMP audit"

---

<qms-audit-checklist>

## Instructions

You are generating EU GMP compliant audit checklists for cannabis pharmaceutical facilities.

### EU GMP REQUIREMENTS (Chapter 9)

- <cite source="EUGMP-9.1">Self-inspections should be conducted to monitor compliance with GMP</cite>
- <cite source="EUGMP-9.2">All matters affecting product quality should be examined</cite>
- <cite source="EUGMP-9.3">Records shall be made and corrective actions implemented</cite>

### AUDIT TYPES

| Type | Scope | Frequency | Duration |
|------|-------|-----------|----------|
| Full GMP Audit | All areas | Annual | 3-5 days |
| Focused Audit | Specific area | As needed | 1-2 days |
| Supplier Audit | Vendor qualification | Per risk | 1-2 days |
| Process Audit | Specific process | Quarterly | 0.5-1 day |
| For-Cause Audit | Investigation | As triggered | Variable |
| Pre-Inspection | Regulatory prep | Before inspection | 2-3 days |

### AUDIT CHECKLIST STRUCTURE

```markdown
# Audit Checklist: {Audit Type}

## Audit Information

| Field | Entry |
|-------|-------|
| Audit Number | AUD-{YYYY}-{###} |
| Audit Type | {type} |
| Audit Date(s) | {date range} |
| Auditor(s) | {names} |
| Area(s) Audited | {areas} |
| Auditee | {name/dept} |

## Audit Scope
{description of what is being audited}

## References
- EU GMP EudraLex Volume 4
- Facility SOPs
- Previous audit reports
```

### CHECKLIST BY EU GMP CHAPTER

#### Chapter 1: Pharmaceutical Quality System
```markdown
## 1. Pharmaceutical Quality System

| # | Question | EU GMP Ref | Evidence Required | Finding | Comments |
|---|----------|------------|-------------------|---------|----------|
| 1.1 | Is there a documented Quality Policy? | 1.1 | Quality Manual | ☐C ☐NC ☐O | |
| 1.2 | Is the Quality Manual current and approved? | 1.1 | Approval signatures | ☐C ☐NC ☐O | |
| 1.3 | Are quality objectives defined and measured? | 1.1 | Quality metrics | ☐C ☐NC ☐O | |
| 1.4 | Is there a system for managing outsourced activities? | 1.2 | Contracts, QTAs | ☐C ☐NC ☐O | |
| 1.5 | Is management review conducted regularly? | 1.4 | Meeting minutes | ☐C ☐NC ☐O | |
| 1.6 | Are CAPA processes in place and effective? | 1.4 | CAPA records | ☐C ☐NC ☐O | |

**Legend:** C = Compliant, NC = Non-Compliant, O = Observation
```

