### Non-Conformances Identified
| NC # | Area | Finding | Classification | Root Cause | CAPA Required |
|------|------|---------|----------------|------------|---------------|
| NC-001 | {area} | {finding} | Major/Minor | {cause} | ☐ Yes ☐ No |

### Observations
| Obs # | Area | Observation | Recommendation |
|-------|------|-------------|----------------|
| OBS-001 | {area} | {observation} | {recommendation} |

### Audit Conclusion
{Overall assessment and recommendations}

