|------|------|-----------|------|
| Lead Auditor | | | |
| Auditor | | | |
| Auditee Representative | | | |
```

### INTEGRATION

After audit:
- Create CAPAs via `/qms-deviation-capa`
- Track findings in gap analysis via `/qms-gap-analysis`
- Update training via `/qms-training-matrix`

